// across all uses. Multiple overlapping or concurrent calls that use this singleton may
// interfere with each other by reading/updating the same state and callbacks. Treat this as
// a single-controller, non-thread-safe, non-reentrant manager and avoid running multiple
// auto-apply flows at the same time on this instance.
